            "reviewBody": "I made a lot of changes to this recipe because I wanted to use ingredients that I had on hand, and I couldn’t find Asiago cheese at the store. I used Sherry vinegar instead of white wine. I used low-fat cream cheese and reduced fat Colby Jack cheese. It’s delicious and I am eager to make it again with Asiago when I can find it.",
